functional_scenario.func_scenario:
Initial actions: 
(V1): V1 drives on Lane 1 at 60 km/h, 15 meters behind V4; (V2): V2 drives on Lane 3 at 70 km/h, 50 meters ahead of V1; (V3): V3 drives on Lane 2 at 65 km/h; (V4): V4 drives on Lane 1 at 40 km/h.

Interactive pattern sequence: 

(V1, V4): V1 decelerates as V4 slows down in front of it on the same lane;
(V1, V3): V1 accelerates as it approaches V3 on the adjacent lane;
(V1, V2): V1 accelerates towards V2 on the adjacent lane while V2 maintains its speed;
(V1, V2): V1 swerve right towards V2 on the adjacent lane while V2 maintains its speed;
(V1, V2): V1 swerve left to avoid V2 while V2 maintains its speed.

